# Strata SDK: Multi-Page Forms — Controller & Routes

`Strata::Flows::ApplicationFormController` is a Rails controller mixin that reads the flow definition and exposes auto-generated `edit_<page>` / `update_<page>` actions for every question page declared in the flow.

